_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Uh9M2WYhCc8\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/Uh9M2WYhCc8 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's a geopolitical RPG series about cyborgs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T10:06:32-08:00","id":1356495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356459#post1356459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Keychain of Creation had a short arc about building Alchemicals in Creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's rather more tongue in cheek than what the thread topic probably has in mind. &quot;Oops, there goes my head again!&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T11:19:01-08:00","id":1356504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356495#post1356495\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's rather more tongue in cheek than what the thread topic probably has in mind. &quot;Oops, there goes my head again!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The principle of an exiled Alchemical doing it by upgrading mortals instead of using demurges to capture heroic souls over multiple generations (or some nerd googling how to make soulsteel from his parent's basement) is what I'm pointing at.<br /> <br /> Start of Arc: <a href=\"https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0116.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0116.html</a><br /> Relevant Bit: <a href=\"https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0133.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0133.html</a><br /> Warstrider fight: <a href=\"https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0165.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0165.html</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 12-22-2019, 02:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T13:26:28-08:00","id":1356523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356504#post1356504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The principle of an exiled Alchemical doing it by upgrading mortals instead of using demurges to capture heroic souls over multiple generations (or some nerd googling how to make soulsteel from his parent's basement) is what I'm pointing at.<br /> <br /> Start of Arc: <a href=\"https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0116.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0116.html</a><br /> Relevant Bit: <a href=\"https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0133.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0133.html</a><br /> Warstrider fight: <a href=\"https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0165.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://keychain.patternspider.net/archive/koc0165.html</a></div> </div> </div> </div>But Alchemicals either require those successive lives of heroic character as an integral part of their concept, or they're Guyvers insted of cyborgs. The latter have retro-futurist mechanical mutations/merits instead of Charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T16:16:52-08:00","id":1356546,"title":"","content":"If super magitek robot people with souls showed up and started doing superhuman feats of strength, ability, and intelligence on Monday then by Tuesday mornign every government in the world would have a plan to kidnap them and strap them down to the operating table. Or if we are being charitable, convince them to work for US against THEM. Because we can trust US with power, but who knows what kind of terrible things THEY will do with power. <br /> <br /> And <i>then</i> we strap them to the operating table.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T18:55:52-08:00","id":1356567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356546#post1356546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If super magitek robot people with souls showed up and started doing superhuman feats of strength, ability, and intelligence on Monday then by Tuesday mornign every government in the world would have a plan to kidnap them and strap them down to the operating table. Or if we are being charitable, convince them to work for US against THEM. Because we can trust US with power, but who knows what kind of terrible things THEY will do with power.<br /> <br /> And <i>then</i> we strap them to the operating table.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fun fact. <br /> <br /> When you said US, I thought you meant &quot;United States&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T10:09:53-08:00","id":1356659,"title":"","content":"I had Alchemicals in a Shard that took place in the 1920s.<br /> <br /> Basically the setting was Dragon-Blooded and Sidereals only until 1916 when the Solars and Lunars entered play (and unbeknownst to everyone else, the Abyssals and Infernals). The Alchemical Exalted came a little later after that as the brainchild of Communist Lunars who'd sought a form of exaltation that would be compatible with their values and ultimately forced to co-exist with mortals rather than rule over them. Working in conjunction with a Daybreak Caste necromancer and a renagade Jadeborn scientist one of their first creations was Stalin so by all accounts they failed <b>spectacularly</b>.<br /> <br /> Lenin isn't dead in the glass coffin but instead had sacrificed much of his essence to make this doomed vision a reality. The Alchemicals themselves were initially created by melting down a lot of the artifact panopolies of the Russian nobility but they were already starting to run out of other materials particularly Starmetal which saw undercover teams being scrambled to every falling meteor in the USSR in the hopes of scoring some, often contested by Sidereal teams who needed it too.<br /> <br /> Their colossi forms were going to resemble military vehicles with some stylistic liberties for the fact they're sentient beings. For example Stalin will as he gains power eventually have taken on a colossi form of a Soviet armoured train (not unlike the one in Golden Eye that's affectionately known as the &quot;Ugly Face Train&quot; by my fianc\u00e9e) trying to hold onto power via drone body as he wandered Russia's railways like if Thomas the Tank Engine was a mad dictator before ultimately merging with Stalingrad to achieve his final form.<br /> <br /> It was fun, helped me unwind while working on my MA.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T10:25:06-08:00","id":1356662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356546#post1356546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If super magitek robot people with souls showed up and started doing superhuman feats of strength, ability, and intelligence on Monday then by Tuesday mornign every government in the world would have a plan to kidnap them and strap them down to the operating table. Or if we are being charitable, convince them to work for US against THEM. Because we can trust US with power, but who knows what kind of terrible things THEY will do with power. <br /> <br /> And <i>then</i> we strap them to the operating table.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's pretty much what I said in Accelerator's thread about Solars in the real world.<br /> <br /> For the purpose of Accelerator's narrative, this doesn't happen.<br /> <br /> Like how super villians SHOULD just shoot the protagonist instead of explaining their plans and putting them in a convoluted death trap. But they don't. Same principle.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356523#post1356523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But Alchemicals either require those successive lives of heroic character as an integral part of their concept, or they're Guyvers insted of cyborgs. The latter have retro-futurist mechanical mutations/merits instead of Charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know where this concept of &quot;Guyvers&quot; comes from. I'm not sure it matters. We're talking about homebrewing Alchemicals into modern day real world. It's homebrew. I've linked to a different homebrew about an Alchemical creating other Alchemical Exalted through SCIENCE! as inspiration. I'm not saying &quot;copy this exactly&quot; because what I've linked to is about Creation in RY778... when OP wants the Real World in AD2019. I'm saying &quot;this is a good alternative take which may inspire you&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356659#post1356659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had Alchemicals in a Shard that took place in the 1920s.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is the most Exalted thing I've ever read.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 12-23-2019, 01:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T13:54:45-08:00","id":1356686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356662#post1356662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I don't know where this concept of &quot;Guyvers&quot; comes from. I'm not sure it matters. We're talking about homebrewing Alchemicals into modern day real world. It's homebrew. I've linked to a different homebrew about an Alchemical creating other Alchemical Exalted through SCIENCE! as inspiration. I'm not saying &quot;copy this exactly&quot; because what I've linked to is about Creation in RY778... when OP wants the Real World in AD2019. I'm saying &quot;this is a good alternative take which may inspire you&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the Exalted: the Modern Era Shard, the Alchemicals were basically Guyvers (as in Guyver: the Bio-Booster Armor) in execution, as medallions that bonded with a host and gave them a robotic-looking shell that could continuously gain new capabilities. They seemed a bit more durable, though, since there was no cracking the medallion and causing the suit to consume its host like in th source material (would have been too on the nose, anyway).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T15:37:33-08:00","id":1356705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356662#post1356662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's pretty much what I said in Accelerator's thread about Solars in the real world.<br /> <br /> For the purpose of Accelerator's narrative, this doesn't happen.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Where? And, well, why would nations dissect robots that they themselves made?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T04:08:33-08:00","id":1356791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/alchemical-exalted/1356436-alchemicals-in-the-modern-world?p=1356705#post1356705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where? And, well, why would nations dissect robots that they themselves made?</div> </div> </div> </div>I pressume Sorcerous Overlord is responding to my idea of having Alchemicals from Autochothonia show up to teach Earth how to build Alchemicals rather than nations dissecting their own tech.<br /> <br /> And you're quite right, I said the government would just snipe a Solar Exalt the moment they revealed themselves. I imagine they would dissect them too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T10:16:58-08:00","id":1356816,"title":"","content":"In Shards of the Exalted Dream, the Exalted Modern shard had Alchemicals as a secret government black project that essentially fused Lunar exaltations with Autochthonian fragments, mixed them with the Magical Materials, and ended up creating a bunch of gemstones that were SUPPOSED to turn people into cyborg slave operatives, but they failed on the slave part.<br /> <br /> They way they work is that you put the gem on a Mortal\u2019s forehead, it extends filaments through the mortal\u2019s body (and soul) turning them into an Alchemical Exalt for the rest of their lives (once they die, it retracts and can be reused). Power-wise, the main difference between them and normal Alchemicals is that, instead of going to a Vat chamber, they can make their Exaltation go Dormant for a similar amount of time to reconfigure itself. They can also grow new charms and slots in their Exaltations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}